 from the waterfall.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Duvili Ella</b> or <b>Walawe Ganga East Falls</b> is a waterfall in Monaragala District, Sri Lanka. It is located in Thanjantenna village.The height of the waterfalls is about 40\u00a0m (130\u00a0ft). The name 'Duwili' is derived from the Sinhalese for dust, which describes the spray emanating from the waterfall.</p>"}